{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen","doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/TwintSDKActionComponent","doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/TwintSDKActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIssuerNumber","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"aside","name":"Important","style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All apps above “twint-issuer39” will always be returned if one of these apps is installed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For this to work, "},{"code":"LSApplicationQueriesSchemes","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" must include “twint-extended”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you configure any "},{"code":"maxIssuerNumber","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" below 39, the result will always contain all apps above "},{"code":"maxIssuerNumber","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"up to and including 39, even if none of them are installed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Additionally, if the fetch fails and the cache is empty, none of these apps will be found when probing."}]}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/TwintSDKActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct\/maxIssuerNumber","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The issuer number of the highest scheme you listed under ","type":"text"},{"code":"LSApplicationQueriesSchemes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"E.g